[Title: HOSHIMACHI SUISEI LIVE TOUR 2024 SPECTRA OF NOVA]

35
00:33:56,178 --> 00:33:58,428
強がりから声を聴かせてください！
Please let me hear your voice through your bravado!

36
00:34:05,228 --> 00:34:11,528
どんな時も どんな時も 駆け抜けていく
