37
00:34:11,528 --> 00:34:16,328
上手な大人になれない
I can't become a proper adult.

38
00:34:17,228 --> 00:34:19,628
そんなことは信用できない できない
I can't believe something like that... I just can't...

39
00:34:21,928 --> 00:34:25,628
迷いで描いて 信じ続ける
Sketching with hesitation, continuing to believe,

40
00:34:25,628 --> 00:34:31,928
手繰り寄せる 手雲を伝えて きっと肌の温もりで
pulling it in, passing down the clouds, surely with the warmth of skin...

41
00:34:32,628 --> 00:34:37,128
猫かぶったまま 降り止まない雨の世界だ
Playing innocent in a world where the rain never stops falling.

42
00:34:37,928 --> 00:34:42,428
もう悲しくない 人殺せる生き物だから
I'm no longer sad, because I'm a creature that can kill.

43
00:34:43,328 --> 00:34:46,328
そう星になった 青春の墓場じみてた
It looked like the graveyard of youth that became stars.

44
00:34:47,128 --> 00:34:53,128
今君に会いたいと思うんだ 込み上げる
Now I find myself wanting to meet you, welling up inside...

45
00:34:59,928 --> 00:35:05,128
踏んばったり 注意散漫 人生の
Stumbling about, easily distracted, in this life...

46
00:35:05,923 --> 00:35:08,733
嵐の時代を乗りこなしていくんだ
Riding out the storm of these times...

47
00:35:08,943 --> 00:35:12,233
止めないで 戦慄のサイレン鳴らして
Don't stop, let the trembling siren wail!

48
00:35:13,563 --> 00:35:17,463
叫び声あげる前のユートピア
