51
00:35:26,863 --> 00:35:31,663
愛するしかない それしかない 昨日じゃないから
We have no choice but to love it, no choice at all, because it's not yesterday anymore.

52
00:35:32,623 --> 00:35:35,333
速記になった青春の何ページ目だっけ
What page of our shorthand youth was this again?

53
00:35:35,613 --> 00:35:40,533
忘れ物思い出せないまま 忘れそう
Unable to remember what we left behind, we're about to forget...

54
00:35:41,923 --> 00:35:48,713
このままじゃ このままじゃ…
Staying like this, staying like this...

55
00:36:04,963 --> 00:36:08,113
見えない 見えないよ あなたが
