74
00:38:42,113 --> 00:38:47,633
ねえねえ一人だけが堪えてるのは Maybe Baby
Hey, hey, is only one of us enduring this, Maybe Baby?

75
00:38:48,113 --> 00:38:54,133
悲しくもないよ 嬉しくもないよ Maybe Baby
It's not sad, it's not happy either, Maybe Baby!

76
00:38:59,113 --> 00:39:02,933
繊細敷きの細工を染める雷に Maybe
